  "title": "Eagle Nuclear Energy Provides First Quarter 2026 Corporate Update",
  "summary": "RENO, Nev., April 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Eagle Nuclear Energy Corp. (“Eagle” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: NUCL), a next-generation nuclear energy company which owns the largest conventional, measured and indicated uranium deposit in the United States, today announced a corporate update and financial results for the first quarter of 2026, ending February 28, 2026.",
